      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"90df24618a856dda\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nWe have treated them overall as interstate wars to make our charts simpler. The conflict-level data by <strong>Project Mars</strong> cannot be neatly mapped to individual countries, which is why we only present aggregated data for the world and world regions.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"90df24618a856dda\">>>",
