      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"37006facc4afe047\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nJ. S. Goldstein, Winning the War on War (Dutton, 2011). ... T. R. Gurr, Ethnic warfare on the wane. Foreign Aff. 79, 52–64 (2000). ... L.-E. Cederman, Back to Kant: Reinterpreting the democratic peace as a macrohistorical learning process. Am. Polit. Sci. Rev. 95, 15–31 (2001). ... M. Roser, E. O. Ospina, J. Mispy, Our World in Data (2017); https://ourworldindata.org.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"37006facc4afe047\">>>",
